# Where sbfnk-bot-issues may open draft pull requests.
#
# One entry per line: an owner (every repository it has) or owner/repo.
# Issues assigned to sbfnk-bot anywhere else are logged and left alone.
#
# "timeout=MINUTES" after an entry gives its jobs longer than the default;
# owner/repo wins over owner. A single job can ask for more with a line
# "bot-time: 3h" in sbfnk's comment or private answer.
epiforecasts
epiforecasts/EpiNow2 timeout=180
mfiidd
nfidd
sbfnk
